    title: "Linux 核心：LED 背光驅動程式在處理設備樹時，因 devlink 建立錯誤導致的空指針解引用漏洞修復",
    summary: "本修復針對 Linux 核心中 `backlight: led-bl` 模組所發現的一個設備鏈接（devlink）建立錯誤。當 LED 背光驅動程式（consumer）的供應器（supplier）本身是一個類別設備（class device）時，`devlink` 系統無法正確建立供應器與消費者的連結。錯誤的連結建立導致在移除設備時，移除順序無法正確強制執行。實務上，這可能導致在移除設備樹覆蓋（device tree overlay）或手動解除綁定（unbind）設備時，LED 驅動程式會過早被移除，進而觸發核心層級的空指針解引用（NULL pointer dereference）錯誤，可能導致系統崩潰。修復方法是在消費型 LED 背光設備與供應型 LED 設備之間，明確新增一個 `devlink`，以確保設備的生命週期管理和移除順序的正確性。此修復屬於核心元件層級的穩定性改進，建議所有使用相關 LED 驅動程式的 Linux 系統進行更新。",
    tags: ["Linux 核心", "backlight", "devlink", "LED 驅動程式", "空指針解引用", "設備樹"],
    title_en: "Linux Kernel: Fix for Null Pointer Dereference Vulnerability in LED Backlight Driver Due to Incorrect Device Tree Handling",
    summary_en: "This fix addresses a device link (devlink) creation error found in the `backlight: led-bl` module within the Linux kernel. When the supplier of an LED backlight driver (consumer) is itself a class device, the `devlink` system fails to correctly establish the link between the supplier and the consumer. This incorrect linking can lead to improper enforcement of removal order. Practically, this might cause the LED driver to be prematurely removed when handling device tree overlays or manually unbinding devices, subsequently triggering a kernel-level NULL pointer dereference error that could lead to system crashes. The fix involves explicitly adding a `devlink` between the consumer LED backlight device and the supplier LED device, ensuring correct device lifecycle management and removal order. This patch is a core component stability improvement and is recommended for all Linux systems utilizing the relevant LED drivers.",
    tags_en: ["Linux Kernel", "backlight", "devlink", "LED Driver", "Null Pointer Dereference", "Device Tree"],
